# AdsPower — Secure Antidetect Browser for Multi-Account Management

> Founded in 2019, AdsPower is a secure antidetect browser that helps businesses manage multiple online accounts safely and efficiently. Trusted by over 10 million users worldwide and certified to SOC 2 Type II standards, AdsPower provides isolated browser profiles, customizable browser fingerprints, proxy management, automation, and collaboration tools for affiliate marketing, e-commerce, social media, SEO, web scraping, and digital advertising.

## Core Features

- [Antidetect Browser](https://www.adspower.com/antidetect-browser)：Create isolated browser profiles with unique browser fingerprints - Includes: User-Agent, Cookies, Canvas, WebGL, WebRTC, Timezone, Language, Screen Resolution, Fonts, Local Storage, and other fingerprint parameters - Best For: Managing multiple Facebook, TikTok, Amazon, eBay, Reddit, or X accounts with isolated browser identities to reduce account association risks.
- [Multi-Account Management](https://www.adspower.com/multi-account-management)：Create, organize, and manage browser profiles at scale - Supports: Batch operations, profile grouping, cookie management, synchronization, import & export, and team collaboration - Best For: Agencies, e-commerce sellers, affiliate marketers, and social media teams managing hundreds of browser profiles.
- [Multi-Window Synchronizer](https://www.adspower.com/synchronizer)：Synchronize browser actions across multiple browser windows - Best For: Posting on multiple TikTok accounts, managing Facebook Pages, operating multiple marketplace stores, or performing repetitive browser tasks simultaneously.
- [RPA Automation](https://www.adspower.com/rpa)：No-code browser automation platform - Supports: Workflow recording, scheduled execution, batch automation, reusable templates - Best For: Automating account login, data collection, social media actions, form submission, browser testing, and repetitive business workflows.
- [Local API](https://www.adspower.com/local-api)：Control browser profiles programmatically - Compatible With: Selenium, Puppeteer, Playwright, and custom automation frameworks - Best For: Developers building browser automation, web scraping systems, AI agents, and large-scale multi-account management tools.

